APPENDIX B: NEGOTIATION TACTICS
B.1 Creating Competition
Contact 3-5 potential acquirers simultaneously
Never reveal other party names
Use phrases like "significant interest from strategic buyers"
Set deadlines: "looking to make decision by X"
B.2 Anchoring High
Start with aspirational number ($25M)
Justify with comparable transactions
Be prepared to negotiate down to acceptable ($15M)
Never give first number if asked
B.3 Handling Low Offers
"We appreciate the interest, but that doesn't reflect the strategic value"
"Given comparable transactions like SafeSend, we'd need to see..."
"We have flexibility on structure but not on total value"
"We're prepared to continue building independently if necessary"
B.4 Walking Away
Have a BATNA (Best Alternative)
Be prepared to say no
"We'd rather build this out than accept a valuation that doesn't reflect potential"
Walking away often brings them back higher
